## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: select region KB, redact input, and query OpenAI
const region = tenant.region;
const kb = fetchKbForRegion(region);
const redacted = redactPII(userInput);
const prompt = buildPrompt(redacted, kb);
const resp = await openai.complete({ prompt, maxTokens: 256 });
